# PETAL PARADE: the field is random. One sun circle at a time (a line
# across the garden, a square ring or a cross) moves somewhere else every
# 10 seconds; three pups wait at a time; brambles crawl out on their own.
game petalparade
wait 20
press A
cheat still
expect pads >= 9
expect star_t > 590
wait 2
expect pups == 3
cheat startime 10
wait 11
expect star_t == 599
expect pads >= 9
expect toadstools == 1
waituntil brambles >= 1 560
